{"id":"177a926e276b1a55","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-term-algebra.md","title":"自由项代数","display":"df-term-algebra — 自由项代数","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-df-term-algebra","aliases":["56-df-term-algebra"],"display":"df-term-algebra — 自由项代数","depends_on":["[[56-df-terms]]","[[56-df-structure]]"],"source_section":"7.1.5","source_pages":"262","source_ocr_blocks":[283],"source_statement_status":"statement-compared-to-local-djvu-ocr","source_proof_status":"not-applicable"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-term-algebra"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-term-algebra</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-term-algebra — 自由项代数"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5e02461ce48023cc\" href=\"?note=5e02461ce48023cc\" title=\"56-df-terms\">56-df-terms</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3544e74f0e48d8ac\" href=\"?note=3544e74f0e48d8ac\" title=\"56-df-structure\">56-df-structure</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"7.1.5"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"262"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>283</span></div>"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"statement-compared-to-local-djvu-ocr"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"not-applicable"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=(F,\\operatorname{ar})\">\\(\\Sigma=(F,\\operatorname{ar})\\)</span> 为签名，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> 为本书变量集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal V\\)</span> 的实例，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)\">\\(T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5e02461ce48023cc\" href=\"?note=5e02461ce48023cc\" title=\"56-df-terms\">56-df-terms</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Algebra}_{\\Sigma}(A,I)\">\\(\\operatorname{Algebra}_{\\Sigma}(A,I)\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3544e74f0e48d8ac\" href=\"?note=3544e74f0e48d8ac\" title=\"56-df-structure\">56-df-structure</a> 中函数签名代数的定义；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in F\">\\(f\\in F\\)</span>。项构造式是自由语法构造子，不是给定模型中的运算取值。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"I_T(f)\\coloneqq\\{((t_1,\\ldots,t_n),f(t_1,\\ldots,t_n)):n=\\operatorname{ar}(f),\\ (t_1,\\ldots,t_n)\\in T^n\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[I_T(f)\\coloneqq\\{((t_1,\\ldots,t_n),f(t_1,\\ldots,t_n)):n=\\operatorname{ar}(f),\\ (t_1,\\ldots,t_n)\\in T^n\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"I_T\\coloneqq\\{(f,I_T(f)):f\\in F\\},\\qquad\\mathbf T(\\Sigma,V)\\coloneqq(T,I_T).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[I_T\\coloneqq\\{(f,I_T(f)):f\\in F\\},\\qquad\\mathbf T(\\Sigma,V)\\coloneqq(T,I_T).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Algebra}_{\\Sigma}(T,I_T).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Algebra}_{\\Sigma}(T,I_T).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对应原书 Definition 7.1.5。T 非空，因为包含变量；每个 I_T(f) 是由有序子项列构造唯一新项的全函数。常元按空元组取值。此代数的元素是语法项，运算本身仍是普通集合函数。</p>\n<p>来源：Terese, <em>Term Rewriting Systems</em>, Cambridge University Press, 2003，7.1.5，印刷页 262。<code>source_ocr_blocks</code> 为本地DjVu文字层页块序号，不是物理扫描页码。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-terms","status":"resolved","id":"5e02461ce48023cc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-terms]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"3544e74f0e48d8ac","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-terms","status":"resolved","id":"5e02461ce48023cc","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $\\Sigma=(F,\\operatorname{ar})$ 为签名，$V$ 为本书变量集 $\\mathcal V$ 的实例，$T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)$ 见 [[56-df-terms]]。$\\operatorname{Algebra}_{\\Sigma}(A,I)$ 取 [[56-df-structure]] 中函数签名代数的定义；$f\\in F$。项构造式是自由语法构造子，不是给定模型中的运算取值。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"3544e74f0e48d8ac","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $\\Sigma=(F,\\operatorname{ar})$ 为签名，$V$ 为本书变量集 $\\mathcal V$ 的实例，$T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)$ 见 [[56-df-terms]]。$\\operatorname{Algebra}_{\\Sigma}(A,I)$ 取 [[56-df-structure]] 中函数签名代数的定义；$f\\in F$。项构造式是自由语法构造子，不是给定模型中的运算取值。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=(F,\\operatorname{ar})","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal V","display":false},{"tex":"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Algebra}_{\\Sigma}(A,I)","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in F","display":false},{"tex":"I_T(f)\\coloneqq\\{((t_1,\\ldots,t_n),f(t_1,\\ldots,t_n)):n=\\operatorname{ar}(f),\\ (t_1,\\ldots,t_n)\\in T^n\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"I_T\\coloneqq\\{(f,I_T(f)):f\\in F\\},\\qquad\\mathbf T(\\Sigma,V)\\coloneqq(T,I_T).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Algebra}_{\\Sigma}(T,I_T).","display":true}],"bytes":1500,"backlinks":[{"id":"10806b2bbdb74dae","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"沿用 [[56-df-term-algebra]] 的 $\\Sigma=(F,\\operatorname{ar})$、$V$、$T$。$G=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma)=\\{t\\in T:\\operatorname{Var}(t)=\\varnothing\\}$ 见 [[56-df-ground-terms]]、[[56-df-variables]]；$f\\in F$。基项结构对所有签名定义，只有非空载体时才称为本书约定的代数。"},{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-245","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-df-term-algebra.md]]"},{"id":"949652e4222b24f5","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"设 $\\Sigma=(F,\\operatorname{ar})$、$T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)$、$E\\subseteq T^2$。$Q=\\equiv_E^{\\Sigma,V}$ 见 [[56-df-equational-theory]]。$(T,I_T)$、$(G,I_G)$ 分别见 [[56-df-term-algebra]]、[[56-df-ground-term-algebra]]，$Q_G=Q\\cap G^2$。同余谓词见 [[56-df-sigma-congruence]]。"}],"outgoing":["5e02461ce48023cc","3544e74f0e48d8ac"]}